ettings in the upper right corner of the main screen to unlock the trailing effect and appearance effects of the elves.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361270/extras/93b70b574fd6ec17c78d8f6ea50a7619.avif?t=1599555887\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361270/extras/76422e0959d1582866b1d820ce3d3ec0.avif?t=1599555887\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endless mode</strong></h2><br>If you have confidence in the elves you created, then challenge the endless pattern! There is no end here, as long as you are excellent, you can experience unprecedented excitement and urgency! Attention! The huge gear is right behind you!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361270/extras/dbd90a16577938fa2cb82d80ea49bd2b.avif?t=1599555887\" data-has-big /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What are you waiting for? Come and create your slime!</strong></h2>",
